 *   <li>3 - teleport to a hub then a moderate run, or a fairy ring plus a walk</li>
 *   <li>4 - regional teleport then a long run</li>
 *   <li>5 - no convenient teleport; a long trek from the nearest reachable point</li>
 * </ul>
 */
